#NEXUS

[ dyer2023a_fig21: Time-calibrated pachycephalosaur tree, 18 tips; the root is drawn as a trichotomy (Pachycephalosauria, Yinlong downsi, Psittacosaurus mongoliensis). Tips keep their printed text (Amtocephale gobienses as printed). Random-sample case (seed 20261106). Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=18;
    TAXLABELS
        Colepiocephale_lambei
        Stegoceras_validum
        Amtocephale_gobienses
        Foraminacephale_brevis
